{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 64,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Hear my voice, God, in my complaint. my life from fear of the enemy.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，我哀叹的时候，求你听我的声音！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，我哀歎的時候，求你聽我的聲音！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Hide me from the conspiracy of the wicked, from the noisy crowd of the ones doing evil;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你把我隐藏，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你把我隱藏，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "who sharpen their tongue like a sword, and aim their arrows, deadly words,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们磨舌如刀，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們磨舌如刀，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "to shoot innocent men from ambushes. They shoot at him suddenly and fearlessly.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "要在暗地射完全人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "要在暗地射完全人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "They encourage themselves in evil plans. They talk about laying snares secretly. They say, “Who will see them?”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们彼此勉励设下恶计；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們彼此勉勵設下惡計；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "They plot injustice, saying, “We have made a perfect plan!” Surely man’s mind and heart are cunning.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们图谋奸恶， ：我们是极力图谋的。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們圖謀奸惡， ：我們是極力圖謀的。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "But God will shoot at them. They will be suddenly struck down with an arrow.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但 神要射他们；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但上帝要射他們；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Their own tongues shall ruin them. them will shake their heads.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们必然绊跌，被自己的舌头所害；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們必然絆跌，被自己的舌頭所害；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "All mankind shall be afraid. They shall declare the work of God, and shall wisely ponder what he has done.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "众人都要害怕，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "眾人都要害怕，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "The righteous shall be glad in the LORD, and shall take refuge in him. All the upright in heart shall praise him!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "义人必因耶和华欢喜，并要投靠他；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "義人必因耶和華歡喜， 並要投靠他；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}